// Planted fixture for profile 1.20: a claim that stands for a chain, as one node in the argument
// (NOTES-integration.md, Proposal B; James's go, 10 Oct 2026). The text's account is supported by a
// trial and attacked by a rival account the text reports; it is the premise of a bridge, whose
// questions then read the chain's steps. test_mechanism.py and the page are held to the same answers.
===
title: "Planted -- a chain as one node"
mechanism:
    question: "Why would the levy cut sugar?"
    levels: [state, people]
    actors:
        gov:    {label: "Government", level: state}
        people: {label: "Shoppers", level: people}
    states:
        levy:   {label: "The levy is imposed", actor: gov, role: intervention}
        dear:   {label: "Sugary drinks cost more", actor: people}
        drink:  {label: "Shoppers drink less sugar", actor: people, role: outcome}
        habit:  {label: "Habit", actor: people}
    chains:
        price:
            label: "The price route"
            question: "How does the levy cut sugar?"
        habit:
            label: "The habit story"
            question: "Why might drinking not fall?"
===

[Levy raises prices]: The levy makes sugary drinks dearer.
    {causes: {from: levy, to: dear, sign: "+", basis: study, chain: price}}

[Dear drinks cut sugar]: Dearer drinks mean less sugar drunk.
    {causes: {from: dear, to: drink, sign: "-", basis: asserted, chain: price}}

[Prices not passed on]: Some say retailers absorb the levy, so prices do not rise. #reported
    {causes: {from: levy, to: dear, sign: "0", basis: asserted, chain: price, stance: rejected}}

[Habit holds]: Habit keeps shoppers drinking whatever the price. #reported
    {causes: {from: habit, to: drink, sign: "+", basis: asserted, chain: habit, stance: rejected}}

[The levy works by price]: The levy cuts sugar by making drinks dearer. {mechanism: price}
    + [A trial found prices rose]: A trial found that prices rose after the levy.
    - [The habit story]: Habit, not price, decides what shoppers drink. #reported {mechanism: habit}

[Health matters]: Less sugar is better for health.

<Impose it>

(1) [The levy works by price]
(2) [Health matters]
-- From a mechanism to what to do {uses: [1, 2]} --
(3) [Impose the levy]: The government should impose the levy.

[Nowhere account]: An account of a chain nobody declared. {mechanism: nowhere}
